# Moxa ioLogik E2262.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Moxa ioLogik E2262 Ethernet Remote I/O — 8-channel TC + 4-channel DO + 8-channel Virtual TC
# | 
# | Source: ioLogik E2200 Series User Manual Edition 7.0, September 2018 (Appendix I)
# | Protocol: Modbus/TCP port 502
# | 
# | TC ch0-7 are physical; Virtual TC ch8-15 are computed (AVG/DIV of physical channels)
# | FC03 (4xxxx R/W): DO + TC configuration registers (primary space below)
# | FC04 (3xxxx R): TC_value u32 hi+lo ch0-15 (0x0000-0x001F, unit 0.1°C/°F or 0.0001mV),
# | TC_minValue u32 hi+lo ch0-15 (0x0020-0x003F), TC_maxValue u32 hi+lo ch0-15 (0x0040-0x005F)
# | FC01 (0xxxx R/W): DO bit ctrl ch0-3, TC reset-min/max
