@vendor=Moxa
@model=ioLogik E2262
@vendor_website=moxa.com
@description=8-TC + 4-DO + 8-virtual-TC Modbus/TCP Ethernet remote I/O (port 502). FC03: DO_pulseOutputCount u32 hi+lo ch0-3 (0-7), DO_pulseLowWidth u32 hi+lo ch0-3 (8-15), DO_pulseHighWidth u32 hi+lo ch0-3 (16-23), DO_mode ch0-3 (24-27, 0=DO 1=Pulse), TC_engineeringUnit ch0-7 (28-35, 0=Celsius 1=Fahrenheit 2=millivolt), VirtualTC_engineeringUnit ch8-15 (36-43, same), TC_sensorType ch0-7 (44-51, 0=J 1=K 2=T 3=E 4=R 5=S 6=B 7=N 8=78.126mV 9=39.062mV 10=19.532mV), VirtualTC_sensorType ch8-15 (52-59, 20=AVG 21=DIV), TC_resetMinValue ch0-15 (60-75, W=1 to reset), TC_resetMaxValue ch0-15 (76-91, W=1 to reset), DO_value ch0-3 (92-95, 0=OFF 1=ON), DO_powerOnStatus ch0-3 (96-99), DO_safeStatus ch0-3 (100-103), DO_pulseOutputStatus ch0-3 (104-107), DO_powerOnPulseStatus ch0-3 (108-111), DO_safeModePulseStatus ch0-3 (112-115), TC_enable ch0-7 (116-123, 0=Disable 1=Enable), IntReg00-23 working (0x0150-0x0167=336-359). FC04: TC_value u32 hi+lo ch0-15 (0-31, unit 0.1), TC_minValue (32-63), TC_maxValue (64-95).
